OL,3,GNEWSAInjured deer dies after dog attack
OL,4,Aby lake                                
OL,6,FAn injured deer has been put down after
OL,7,Fit was attacked by a dog near a lake in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.                        
OL,10,FLinjoy Wildlife Sanctuary in Etwall,   
OL,11,FDerbyshire, said it was called by a    
OL,12,Fmember of the public at about 08:30 GMT
OL,13,Fon Wednesday after the deer had been   
OL,14,Fattacked at Albert Village Lake.       
OL,16,FThe sanctuary said the deer had an     
OL,17,Folder, healed fracture to its left leg,
OL,18,Fwhich would have made it slower to get 
OL,19,Faway, and its other leg and groin had  
OL,20,F"multiple bite marks", which left the  
OL,21,Fmuscle torn.                           
